    "lawCode": "Add §343-x, Hway L",
    "lawSection": "Highway Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S6705A\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn act to amend the highway law, in relation to the designation of a\nportion of the state highway system to be known as the \"Charles Varese\nMemorial Highway\"\n\nSUMMARY:\nThis bill would add a new section, 343-x, to the highway law.  The\nsection would designate the section of state route 25A in the Village of\nNorthport, county of Suffolk, shall be known as the \"Charles Varese\nMemorial Highway\". The bill also directs the commissioner of transporta-\ntion to provide for the installation and maintenance of adequate signing\nof the state highway, however the designation shall be one of a ceremo-\nnial nature and the official name of such highway shall not be changed\nas a result.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\nOn April 15 of 2005 Charles Varese was killed on his way to the North-\nport Firehouse, where he bravely served his community as a volunteer\nfirefighter. It is our duty to honor and memorialize those individuals\nwho exemplify the highest of admirable qualities in men so that we may\ncontinue striving for greatness. Charles Varese's selfless acts in his\nservice as a firefighter and community role model are a testament to his\ncharacter. Men like Charles Varese are few and far between, and as such\nmust be acknowledged\n\nFISCAL IMPACT:\nNegligible.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
